      "description": "A historical scene depicting European traders on a beach, gesturing and standing near a group of enslaved Africans, some seated and some standing, with ships visible in the background. The scene is overlaid with the text 'black friday sale', creating a hateful and racially charged juxtaposition.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
